cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this handbook, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "ESG Workflows Handbook"
abstract: >-
  Free, practical step-by-step workflows for CBAM, Scope 3, VSME and CSRD / ESRS,
  with worked examples on fictional companies, Excel and Word templates, browser
  tools and a Python package (esgcalc) that recomputes every number.
  Self-reviewed by its author; not yet reviewed by an external practitioner.
  Not legal advice.
